{"_id": "Yps14MainScreen1", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Main Screen", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14MainScrPg01", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">YPSILON 14 CONTROL TERMINAL\n&gt; DIAGNOSTICS\n&gt; SCHEDULE\n&gt; CONTROLS\n&gt; ROSTER\n&gt; COMMS</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 100, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14DiagMenu01X", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Diagnostics", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14DiagMnuPg01", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">DIAGNOSTICS\n&gt; LAYOUT\n&gt; STATUS\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 200, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14LayoutImg01", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Station Layout", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14LayotImgPg1", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<div style=\"background:#030e03;padding:1rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;text-align:center\"><img src=\"modules/fvtt_mosh_1e_traaash/images/ypsilon-14_layout.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block\"></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 300, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14StatusWarn1", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — System Status", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14StatWrnPg01", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<section class=\"secret\"><p>The station is not exactly up to code.</p></section><div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">STATUS\nSYSTEMS CHECK ...\nWARNING: AIR FILTERS LAST REPLACED 455 DAYS AGO\n(255 DAYS PAST RECOMMENDATION)\nWARNING: SHOWER 5 OUT OF ORDER AS OF 1 DAY AGO\nWARNING: MINESHAFT ELEVATOR LAST MAINTAINED 455 DAYS AGO\n(255 DAYS PAST RECOMMENDATION)\nWARNING: AIRFLOW 82%\n(SUBOPTIMAL: REPLACE FILTERS AND CHECK VENTS FOR BLOCKAGES)\nALL SYSTEMS WITHIN ACCEPTABLE OPERATING CONDITIONS\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 400, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14ScheduleL01", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Schedule", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14SchedLogPg1", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<section class=\"secret\"><p>Replace 'IMV GRASSHOPPER' with your players' ship. If players go back further in the logs, there's just more of the MV Vasquez XV and CTV Horn ov Plenty alternating each month. Reset astral calendar 666 to campaign calendar.</p></section><div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">SCHEDULE\n666-07-02 06:33 - IMV GRASSHOPPER    - RESUPPLY - DOCKING BAY 2 - DOCK\n666-06-04 08:34 - RSV THE HERACLES   - RESEARCH - DOCKING BAY 1 - DOCK\n666-06-02 12:23 - CTV HORN OV PLENTY - RESUPPLY - DOCKING BAY 2 - DEPART\n666-06-01 16:04 - CTV HORN OV PLENTY - RESUPPLY - DOCKING BAY 2 - DOCK\n666-05-02 08:32 - MV VASQUEZ XV      - PICKUP   - DOCKING BAY 1 - DEPART\n666-05-01 06:02 - MV VASQUEZ XV      - PICKUP   - DOCKING BAY 1 - DOCK\n666-04-02 13:02 - CTV HORN OV PLENTY - RESUPPLY - DOCKING BAY 2 - DEPART\n666-04-01 15:54 - CTV HORN OV PLENTY - RESUPPLY - DOCKING BAY 2 - DOCK\n666-06-02 08:33 - MV VAZQUEZ XV      - PICKUP   - DOCKING BAY 1 - DEPART\n666-06-01 06:04 - MV VAZQUEZ XV      - PICKUP   - DOCKING BAY 1 - DOCK\n&gt; MORE\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 500, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14RosterLst01", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Roster", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14RstLstPg01X", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">ROSTER\n01. VERHOEVEN, SONYA     - OVERSEER\n02. SINGH, ASHRAF        - BREAKER\n03. DE BEERS, DANA       - HEAD DRILLER\n04. HUIZINGA, JEROME     - ASST. DRILLER\n05. TOBIN, ROSA          - MINING ENGINEER\n06. MIKKELSEN, MICHAEL   - MINING ENGINEER\n07. KANTARO, KENJI       - LOADER\n08. OBOWE, MORGAN        - LOADER\n09. KENBISHI, RIE        - PUTTER\n10. VACANT\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 600, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14CtrlMenu01X", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Controls", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14CntlMnuPg01", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<section class=\"secret\"><p>The [A] indicates 'Administrator.'</p></section><div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">CONTROLS\n&gt; AIRLOCKS\n&gt; SHOWERS\n&gt; SYSTEM [A]\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 700, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14AirlockL01X", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Airlocks", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14AirlokPg01X", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<section class=\"secret\"><p>Players can lock and unlock the airlocks from here. The airlocks must be closed manually before they can be locked.</p></section><div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">AIRLOCKS\nDOCKING BAY 1 [&gt; LOCKED]\nDOCKING BAY 2 [&gt; UNLOCKED]\nMINESHAFT     [&gt; UNLOCKED]\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 800, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14ShowerOff01", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Showers", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14ShwrOffPg01", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<section class=\"secret\"><p>Players can remotely control the showers from here. Shower 5 is broken and can't be turned on.</p></section><div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">SHOWERS\nSHOWER 1 [&gt; OFF]\nSHOWER 2 [&gt; OFF]\nSHOWER 3 [&gt; OFF]\nSHOWER 4 [&gt; OFF]\nSHOWER 5 [&gt; OFF]\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 900, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14SysLocked01", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — System (Locked)", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14SysLkdPg01X", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<section class=\"secret\"><p>Show this screen if the players try to access System without Sonya's keycard.</p></section><div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">SYSTEM\n[ACCESS DENIED. ADMIN KEYCARD REQUIRED.]\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 1000, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14SysGrantd01", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — System (Unlocked)", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14SysUnlkPg01", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<section class=\"secret\"><p>Show this screen if the players have Sonya's keycard or successfully hack the terminal.</p></section><div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">SYSTEM\n[ACCESS GRANTED. WELCOME, SONYA.]\n&gt; LIFE SUPPORT\n&gt; SCUTTLE\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 1100, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14LifeSupp01X", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Life Support", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14LifSupPg01X", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<section class=\"secret\"><p>This isn't going to help much, since the monster doesn't need oxygen.</p></section><div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">LIFE SUPPORT\nLIFE SUPPORT [&gt; ON]\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 1200, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14ScuttleS01X", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Scuttle", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14ScuttlPg01X", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">SCUTTLE\n[WARNING: THIS WILL INITIATE A 10-MINUTE STATION SELF-DESTRUCT SEQUENCE.\nTYPE 'SCUTTLE' TO INITIATE. SEQUENCE IS IRREVERSIBLE AFTER 5 MINUTES.]\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 1300, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
{"_id": "Yps14CommsShip01", "name": "Ypsilon 14 — Comms", "pages": [{"_id": "Yps14CommShpPg01", "name": "Terminal", "type": "text", "title": {"show": false, "level": 1}, "text": {"content": "<section class=\"secret\"><p>Replace 'IMV GRASSHOPPER' with your players' ship. If any other ships are nearby, add them.</p></section><div style=\"background:#030e03;color:#33dd22;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid #1a4a1a;line-height:1.6\"><pre style=\"margin:0;font-family:inherit;background:transparent;color:inherit;white-space:pre\">COMMS\nSCANNING FOR NEARBY SHIPS...\n&gt; HAIL RSV THE HERACLES\n&gt; HAIL IMV GRASSHOPPER\n&lt; BACK</pre></div>", "format": 1, "markdown": ""}, "video": {"controls": true, "volume": 0.5}, "image": {"caption": ""}, "src": null, "system": {}, "sort": 0, "ownership": {}, "flags": {}}], "folder": null, "sort": 1400, "ownership": {"default": 0}, "flags": {}, "_stats": {"systemId": "mosh", "systemVersion": "0.4.0", "coreVersion": "11.308", "createdTime": 1730000000000, "modifiedTime": 1730000000000, "lastModifiedBy": "6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
